{"id":"s1.3.6","slug":"difference-of-squares","title":"Difference of Squares","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">The difference of squares is a fundamental algebraic identity: $x^2 - y^2 = (x - y)(x + y)$. This trick is easily recognizable and simplifies calculations involving the subtraction of two squared numbers.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">For example, to calculate $54^2 - 55^2$, you can apply the formula:</p><p>$(54 - 55)(54 + 55) = (-1)(109) = -109$</p><p>This method is significantly faster than calculating each square individually and then subtracting.</p>","summary":"The difference of squares is a fundamental algebraic identity: .","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem of the form a^2 - b^2 where a and b are two-digit numbers.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $73^2 - 72^2$.","answer":"145","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $36^2 - 34^2$.","answer":"140","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $57^2 - 58^2$.","answer":"-115","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $67^2 - 66^2$.","answer":"133","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $69^2 - 67^2$.","answer":"272","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $54^2 - 55^2$.","answer":"-109","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $67^2 - 65^2$.","answer":"264","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $88^2 - 87^2$.","answer":"175","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $48^2 - 49^2$.","answer":"-97","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":10,"text":"Calculate $97^2 - 96^2$.","answer":"193","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":11,"text":"Calculate $77^2 - 76^2$.","answer":"153","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":12,"text":"Calculate $54^2 - 53^2$.","answer":"107","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":13,"text":"Calculate $42^2 - 44^2$.","answer":"-172","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic"]},{"id":1